e=\"margin-top:14px\"><li>MEP</li><li>Structure</li><li>Facade</li><li>Precast</li></ul></div>    <div><p class=\"lab\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">Typical tools</p><div class=\"chiprow \"><span>Revit</span><span>AutoCAD</span><span>Fabrication tools</span></div></div>  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"paper pad\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">From the portfolio</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Shop Drawings <em>delivered.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/case-studies/#register\">Portfolio register <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/case-studies/ghadan-21-e25-streetscape/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Ghadan 21 – E25 Streetscape</b><span>Abu Dhabi</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 400</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/museum-of-the-future-jet-link-bridge/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Museum of the Future – Jet-Link Bridge</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\"l\"></span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/electrical-bim-modeling-retail-and-shopping-centre/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Electrical BIM Modeling: Retail &#038; Shopping Centre</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 400</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/steel-structure-detailing/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Steel Structure BIM &#038; Detailing: Warehouse &#038; Industrial</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 400</span></a></li></ul>\n</div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Delivery workflow</p><h2 class=\"h2\">How Shop Drawings <em>runs.</em></h2></div><p class=\"lead\">Five stages, with QA/QC before anything is issued.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"flow f5\"><div class=\"rv\"><b>01</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Scope &amp; BEP</h3><p>Confirm deliverables, LOD/LOI matrix and standards.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>02</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Coordinated model</h3><p>Shop drawing scope confirmed against the latest clash-free federated model.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>03</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Drawing extraction</h3><p>Plans, sections and details extracted with dimensions, levels and tags.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>04</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">QA/QC</h3><p>Run model health, standards and clash checks before issue.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>05</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Consultant approval</h3><p>Comment cycles resolved and resubmitted until the drawings are approved.</p></div></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap pn\">\n  <a href=\"/bim-services/infrastructure-bim/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1440\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-infra.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Aerial view of a highway interchange with green landscaping\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-infra.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-infra-300x225.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-infra-1024x768.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-infra-768x576.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-infra-1536x1152.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"lab\">Previous service</span><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">Infrastructure BIM</h2></a>\n  <a href=\"/bim-services/rebar-detailing/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-pj-steel-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Steel roof structure with red and blue members\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-pj-steel-1.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-pj-steel-1-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-pj-steel-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-pj-steel-1-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-pj-steel-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"lab\">Next service</span><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">Rebar Detailing</h2></a>\n</div></section>\n","cta":"<img class=\"bg\" srcset=\"/assets/img/dxb-night-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/dxb-night.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/assets/img/dxb-night.jpg\" alt=\"Dubai Marina towers lit at night\" loading=\"lazy\">    <p class=\"lab\">Next step</p><h2 class=\"display\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Start your <em>shop drawings scope.</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"btns\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/request-talent/\">Request BIM professionals <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"tel:+971588672901\">+971 58 867 2901</a></div>"}